variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Độ khó:</strong></span><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Sáng tạo (3 sao)</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:4pt;margin-top:12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#2e75b6;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>1. Mục tiêu kiến thức đạt được</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-left:18pt;margin-top:2pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">·</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:6.999999999999999pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#262626;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Sử dụng chức năng Weight Route Predicate của Spring Cloud Gateway kết hợp với Load Balancer để điều hướng phân bổ lưu lượng theo tỷ lệ phần trăm (A/B Testing).</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:4pt;margin-top:12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#2e75b6;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>2. Tình huống nghiệp vụ</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:6pt;margin-top:2pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#262626;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">VietMart vừa phát triển phiên bản V2 cho&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#c7254e;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>search-service</strong></span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#262626;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> với thuật toán tìm kiếm tối ưu hơn. Để đảm bảo an toàn, ban giám đốc muốn thực hiện A/B Testing: 80% lưu lượng người dùng vẫn sẽ được Gateway điều hướng về&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#c7254e;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>search-service-v1</strong></span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#262626;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> (phiên bản ổn định hiện tại), và 20% lưu lượng sẽ được đẩy sang&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#c7254e;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>search-service-v2</strong></span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#262626;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> (để thử nghiệm). Họ muốn thực hiện việc này hoàn toàn trên Gateway thông qua file cấu hình&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#c7254e;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>application.yml</strong></span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#262626;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> mà không phải code thêm bất cứ class Java nào.</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:4pt;margin-top:12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#2e75b6;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>3. Yêu cầu của bài toán</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:6pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#595959;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.999999999999998pt;\"><i><span style=\"font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>3.1. Khai báo YAML</strong></span></i></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-left:18pt;margin-top:2pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">·</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:6.999999999999999pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#262626;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Viết file&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#c7254e;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>application.yml</strong></span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#262626;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> cho API Gateway khai báo 2 route riêng biệt cho&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#c7254e;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>search-service-v1</strong></span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#262626;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> và&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#c7254e;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>search-service-v2</strong></span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#262626;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">.</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-left:18pt;margin-top:2pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">·</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:6.999999999999999pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#262626;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Sử dụng predicate&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#c7254e;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Weight</strong></span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#262626;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> của Spring Cloud Gateway để cấu hình nhóm \"SearchGroup\" với tỷ lệ tạ (weight) tương ứng là 8 và 2.</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:6pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#595959;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.9999999999