mal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">·</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:6.999999999999999pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#262626;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Khởi chạy thử nghiệm nghiệm thu: tạo 2 ứng dụng Spring Boot giả lập trả về dòng chữ \"V1\" và \"V2\" khi gọi&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#c7254e;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>/api/search</strong></span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#262626;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">, gửi 100 request qua Gateway và thống kê kết quả.</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:4pt;margin-top:12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#2e75b6;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>4. Kết quả mong muốn</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-left:18pt;margin-top:2pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:no